កម្មវិធី គ្រប់គ្រងអង្គចងចាំ: 4.

>> Doubler := វត្ថុ ថ្មី.
>> Multiplier := វត្ថុ ថ្មី.
Doubler ពេលទទួល: ['double:and:'] ធ្វើ: { :x :y
	>> q := x + 1. <- ((x × 2) + (y × 2)).
}.

Multiplier ពេលទទួល: ['multiply:and:'] ធ្វើ: { :x :y <- (x × y).
}.

លទ្ធផល សរសេរ: (
	Doubler double:
		(Doubler double: 
			(Multiplier multiply: 2 and: 3)
		and:
			(Multiplier multiply: 3 and: 4)
		)
	and:
		(Doubler double: 
			(Multiplier multiply: 2 and: 3)
		and:
			(Multiplier multiply: 3 and: 4)
		)
), បន្ទាត់ថ្មី.
